  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pro-Bsqueda will work with 250 Salvadorans who were separated from their families during the civil war or were affected by &quot;disappearances&quot; as a result of the armed conflict. It will help them develop a more reliable food supply, will create opportunities for employment, will fund microbusinesses and will offer scholarships enabling some to complete vocational training or work toward a university degree.</narrative>
  </description>
